  <item>
    <title>Sp02「恋爱兄妹」终选CP复盘！好看 or NO？我们的看法恢复“中立”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667a2c36b6a841272918837a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667a2c36b6a841272918837a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Jun 2024 02:32:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【今天有点烦 Sp.02】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 @远山遥</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 @啾娃 （电台：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65d061c2d30b9ecd969379cf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65d061c2d30b9ecd969379cf"><span>尝尝咸淡</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也在看《恋爱兄妹》吗？这是一档正在连载中的韩国恋爱综艺，《换乘》系列导演李珍姝的新作，讲述了5对兄妹or姐弟共同参与为期三周的共同生活，与手足共同选择未来的交往对象。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大结局播出之后，我与影视评论主播啾娃线下面基，一起对终选结局的几对争议cp进行一场酣畅淋漓的讨论复盘，烂尾的编剧还是人性的必然？在看似离谱的嘉宾行为当中，我们又能获取哪些可贵而真实的信息，对我们的现实人生和情感道路，会有什么实用性的启发吗？</span><br><span> </span><br><span>不尽人意也好，曲终人散也罢，这三个月的沉浸式体验让我们对嘉宾和节目都产生了各种各样的情绪和情感，即使节目迎来最终的尾声，也希望通过声音的交流让这份难忘的感受驻留地再久一点。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>龙宇&amp;智媛，狂傲哥与清醒姐真的绝配？</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">06:35</a> 龙宇说话方式的底层逻辑</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a> &nbsp;自导自演的痴情大戏</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">14:51</a> &nbsp;龙宇一直是智媛的第一选择</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">16:46</a> 拒绝的合理化是一把刺向他人的剑</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1312">21:52</a> &nbsp;智媛的自我怜爱与爱情幻想</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> &nbsp;不交流不求助，熬夜苦想的智媛在逃避什么</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>世承&amp;正燮 灿烂之人爱谁都是一场盛放</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2108">35:08</a> 吵架上是模范情侣</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 高敏男人懦夫比勇士多</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> 女追男的双向困境</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2859">47:39</a> 现实是最客观的借口</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">53:10</a> &nbsp;被偏爱的一方需要更成熟懂珍惜</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>随意漫谈 三个月来我想…</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3311">55:11</a> 允允CP：我爱你热烈专一，你待我真诚珍惜</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3357">55:57</a> 相同？不同？爱一个具体的人而不是一个想象</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3689">1:01:29</a> 动人的年下恋，少年一般的勇气与莽撞</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3918">1:05:18</a> 温暖如哲贤 爱人如饮水</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4270">1:11:10</a> 不要惧怕失败 多认知多体验</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4507">1:15:07</a> mbti的局限性 标签之下各不相同</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4731">1:18:51</a> 我们推荐「恋爱兄妹」的理由</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
