  <item>
    <title>Sp01「恋爱兄妹」大结局！世承x正燮 越吵越有，宰亨x智媛 等一个男孩长大要多久？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666bdc91b6a8412729b1fddc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666bdc91b6a8412729b1fddc</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Jun 2024 06:00:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【今天有点烦 Sp.01】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 @远山遥</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 @太子 &nbsp;（电台：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6438a053116792abf9ddd478" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6438a053116792abf9ddd478"><span>螺旋下降</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也在看《恋爱兄妹》吗？这是一档正在连载中的韩国恋爱综艺，《换乘》系列导演李珍姝的新作，讲述了5对兄妹or姐弟共同参与为期三周的共同生活，与手足共同选择未来的交往对象。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天邀请到太子，八年的资深恋综爱好者，也是播客7期节目以来第一位男嘉宾，我们从男性与女性的不同视角，深入解读分析21与51两对cp的情感脉络和走向。</span></p><span></span><p><span>戏里戏外，真真假假，原生家庭和亲密关系的多重建构，在有限的信息与无限的想象之中，除了节目的娱乐性，在这场大型人性观察中，我们还能获得什么样更深层次的启发？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>世承x正燮</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a> 一开始就看好？物质、认知、沟通模式全方位匹配的两个人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="538">08:58</a> 女把恋综当生活，男把恋综当游戏</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">10:02</a> 脱离节目回到现实，正燮不会是一个“渣男”？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> 他为什么像AI？被框架限定的自我牢笼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1349">22:29</a> 男性视角，镜头之下的承诺太重了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1671">27:51</a> 解释行为比行为本身更重要</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>宰亨x智媛</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2247">37:27</a> 宰亨的多面性，体贴又自恋，成熟又幼稚</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2431">40:31</a> 被伤害就闹脾气，宰亨内心的小男孩还没长大</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2594">43:14</a> 智媛的纠结来自高压现实，留给感情的精力所剩无几</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2743">45:43</a> 女性更容易给男性套标签下判断？感情中的弱者恐惧</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>延伸讨论</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2974">49:34</a> 允荷x允在，风花雪月与人间烟火</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3395">56:35</a> 龙宇没有刻意，他的人生本来就是一场自满的戏</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3571">59:31</a> 蔑视情绪，缺乏引导，社会规训，演员龙宇是如何炼成的？</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmfnmhAZAKw7ttDHVztspG1s5dUk.m4a" length="76313168" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqraX8ILIk3FicsOJ0XG2t4OTTb5.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>05「独居初体验」自由与孤独一体两面，勇气与恐惧一线之隔</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663f4e4ab813c7172b63e05c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663f4e4ab813c7172b63e05c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 May 2024 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【今天有点烦 Vo.05】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 @远山遥</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 @peiqin &nbsp;（电台：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64b7d202097f9af4c64cb649" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64b7d202097f9af4c64cb649"><span>山手线上睡着了</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>去年五月至今整整一年，是我人生中真正意义上开始长期独居的第一年，同时也是peiqin来到日本之后独居的第三年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是害怕独居的关系依赖型人，peiqin是向往独居的独立型人，我们以两种截然不同的心态和视角看待独居生活，也有很多不同或相同的体验感受灵光乍现在我们日常的交流中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>4月清明假期我来到日本与peiqin线下相聚，在极为难得的旅途时光中，我们决定花费一晚上的时间来专门聊聊关于女性独居的话题...</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>独居怎么样？评价独居要从群居讲起</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">01:41</a> 真难受啊，军事化宿舍生活</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a> 群居生活绕不开我的洁癖</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> 这不是谁的错，但生活习惯不同让我和合租舍友闹翻了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="704">11:44</a> 青春和星空，说说美好的群居生活！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>恐怖的独居生活</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">16:29</a> 我的思想钢印：总觉得自己一个人活不下去</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">23:07</a> 环境恐惧是什么？因为过于怕黑我去做了心理咨询</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 遭贼了，当我惊醒看到贼趴在窗户上用手电筒照我</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 离谱的日本新闻，住在通风口里的陌生男人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1819">30:19</a> 锁坏了被关在卫生间三天的独居女孩</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>别怕！安全独居的小技巧</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1899">31:39</a> 比起监控器，电子猫眼更安全</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a> 伪装有男人在家，真是个讨巧但讨厌的小技巧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2204">36:44</a> 我又又又遭贼了？物理阻门很重要</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a> 看我秦王绕柱！这样结构的家更安全</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>孤独的耐受力</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a> 生病时的脆弱最无奈</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2598">43:18</a> 家是我的龟壳，孤独有时是一件好事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2693">44:53</a> 习惯孤独的过程一波三折</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2861">47:41</a> 这次是我主动选择了独居生活</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>我的领地，我的规则</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3016">50:16</a> 别在床上吃东西</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3081">51:21</a> 洗完澡把头发捡起来</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a> 把马桶盖子盖上</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3156">52:36</a> 吃饭不允许狼吞虎咽</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>请更好地生活吧！</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3331">55:31</a> 我开始做饭了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3368">56:08</a> “最坏的时候懂得吃，舍得穿，不会乱”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a> 胡思乱想的时候试试做家务吧！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>女人都有自己的房间</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3505">58:25</a> 我与伴侣最好分开两个房间</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3594">59:54</a> 有点突然的人生建议？不想笑的时候可以不用附和别人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3688">1:01:28</a> 结语：在物理与精神的上双重独立</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>BGM：陈奕迅「倒带人生」来自peiqin推荐</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>————End————</span></p>]]></description>
