  <item>
    <title>04「容貌不焦虑」没事！在我的镜头下你是唯一女主角</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661d63b048c40e2fb086d64e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661d63b048c40e2fb086d64e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Apr 2024 17:28:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【今天有点烦 Vo.04】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 @远山遥</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 @小蛋（小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b6aeaec552b750001363505" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b6aeaec552b750001363505"><span>@排气扇子</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小蛋是一位02年的独立胶片摄影师，今年是她从事独立摄影的第二年，拍摄了100多个女孩，从常驻地上海到全国各地，从16至35岁，从素人到模特到爱豆，她的相机中记录着各式各样各不相同的面孔，从摄影师的角度，审美有什么不同，又是如何看待容貌焦虑这件事？</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间倒回2019，也是我与小蛋相识的第一年，那年她17岁，在读高二的她已经拿起了相机成为了「站姐」。我们作为同好相识，天南海北的行程跟拍中，也见证了看似“不务正业”的她，在「站姐」身份下极强的执行能力和如火热情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>或许从那个时刻开始我就意识到，小蛋是一个“不走寻常路”、只会为热爱熊熊燃烧的人。而作为一个女孩，她向来敏感多情，成长也教会她如何从自卑走向自信，从困惑走向坚定，并不断收获一个又一个来自事业、爱情、生活的成功奖励。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当这样的她选择将小众的胶片独立摄影作为事业，又会在创作过程中诞生哪些有意思的故事？她又是如何帮助那些自卑的女孩们面对镜头恐惧，并让她们发现自己原来这么自信这么美——</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>美是生命力</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a></span></strong><span> 我一开始约拍是因为胶卷用不完了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 素人很美，美不要太局限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">04:01</a> 很多女孩会因为自卑向摄影师道歉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> 通过拍摄事前问卷，我能找到最适合客妹的风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> 遇到害怕镜头的客妹，我会把相机藏起来聊天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1047">17:27</a> 抓拍比摆拍更有生命力</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>令人崩溃的摄影工作</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">19:51</a> 摄影师是不被尊重的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1321">22:01</a> 合作男博主乱放鸽子，当我发帖他才道歉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们也曾容貌焦虑</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">29:27</a> 因为眼睛不对称我去日本做手术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">30:57</a> 口呼吸让我没有下巴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 只要幸福，我可以不接受外貌评价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2069">34:29</a> 当我们找到适合自己的风格</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>哦吼！我的拍摄真的很有风格</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2226">37:06</a> 奇怪的衣服很上镜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2442">40:42</a> 比起特写我更喜欢拍大景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2642">44:02</a> 更喜欢作为独立摄影风吹日晒的自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2714">45:14</a> 瓶颈期之后，找到风格的我开挂了</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>结语</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a> 拒绝不怀好意的评价！我们有自己的审美定义</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>BGM：BTS「Dynamite」来自小蛋推荐</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>————End————</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lurNRa79sifDm8ETaWnebINujsgC.m4a" length="48342960" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1LVJDTThoSEYwMnVPTUU2TlBRVmRJdGxFMXkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>03「职业即人生」裸辞后靠自媒体赚钱？热爱是命中注定的事业</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fe85c91519139e4f165272</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fe85c91519139e4f165272</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 23 Mar 2024 07:33:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【今天有点烦 Vo.03】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 @远山遥</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 @小马（小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5f54f0790000000001007b69" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5f54f0790000000001007b69"><span>@小马来野</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>六年前，湖南卫视《幻乐之城》的一场节目录制中，我与小马因为座位相邻而相识。那时我们刚走出校园三年，来自厦门大学的我与来自武汉大学的她，幼稚地争论着谁的母校才是中国最美高校...</span></p><span></span><p><span>而今六年过去，我们共同跨入了30岁行列，见证了对方点滴成长的我们，比起闺蜜更像并肩而行的战友，在事业与生活方面相互陪伴、激励前行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>32岁的小马三年前与老公共同经营的户外博主小红书账号已近4w粉丝，从爱好到副业，从副业到主业，从光鲜亮丽的金融行业裸辞的她，在职业选择与人生规划上，有哪些考量和烦恼？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>辞职这件事，我焦虑了很久</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 2600的社保让人心疼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">03:45</a> 我们是不知不觉成为户外博主</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">06:32</a> 自媒体收入的周期性不稳定</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a> 对不起！金融实在干不下去了</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>裸辞蜜月期，爽！</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> 我终于有时间生一场大病</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="883">14:43</a> 10点睡7点醒的flag在辞职后实现了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a> 掌控节奏，不再被DDL追赶的人生</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>赚钱是一种与行业无关的能力</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1161">19:21</a> 经济下行时代，赚钱的能力都会回归本质</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1386">23:06</a> 摄影？翻译？家教？我全部都想过</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a> 自媒体是普通人最好的杠杆</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">29:39</a> 如何找到最适合自己的自媒体方向？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>人生规划？选择你最想要的东西</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2397">39:57</a> 没贷没娃的生活是裸辞的底气</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2584">43:04</a> 去伪存真，主动构建自己生活的秩序</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">48:40</a> 匹配我的能力与欲望，不存在既要又要的人生</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>裸辞不是躺平，我比以前更努力</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3306">55:06</a> 上厕所还在干的，就是我命中注定的事业</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3497">58:17</a> 虽然爱好变成工作，我希望保持距离持续热爱</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3635">1:00:35</a> 从自嗨到接受反馈，这是自媒体的必然过程</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3809">1:03:29</a> 三分热度的人生并不失败</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>结语</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4039">1:07:19</a> 你的人生是过去与未来的总和</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4260">1:11:00</a> 事业即是完成人生</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>BGM：瓦伊纳&amp;任素汐「大梦 (live ver.)」来自小马推荐</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>————End————</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhfuCrhddbCDGE71eCjZGHPWhSlw.m4a" length="70049371" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1NzliY0stUldoUVdGeTlzLWZpbC1KRW5NS1QucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>02「社交断舍离」不用讨好所有人，只要温暖轻盈的关系</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f411fc676495707985b1a7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f411fc676495707985b1a7</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Mar 2024 09:16:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【今天有点烦 Vo.02】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 @远山遥</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 @peiqin &nbsp;（电台：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64b7d202097f9af4c64cb649" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64b7d202097f9af4c64cb649"><span>山手线上睡着了</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>我与peiqin在腾讯视频工作时并不相熟，而五年后的某天，突然因为kpop重新成为了联系热络的网友。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在日本留学的她与我有1个小时的微小时差，但每个难以自抑的夜晚凌晨都是对方倾听烦恼，收获慰藉的灵魂友人。不管是细枝末节的生活还是重大的人生节点，距离好像从来就没有阻断过情绪的流动共振。</span></p><span></span><p><span>和将友情作为人生结构单元的她，最重视友情的她，聊聊社交这件事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>社交断舍离</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:27</a> 社交烦恼，突然关门的朋友</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">05:07</a> 最令人幸福的朋友数量是3-5个</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>讨好型的人生</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> 早慧的小孩天生就擅长讨好</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a> 懦弱令我害怕不讨好别人</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>自我与他人的边界</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> 教侄女写字，被反问什么叫写字规范</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a> 疏离的日本朋友，让我学会把自己放在第一位</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1357">22:37</a> 最好的关系，像夏天的被子一样轻盈</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>面对矛盾，解决矛盾</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> 战斗还是逃跑？也许是基因的选择</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a> 非暴力沟通的小技巧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> 我的NPD前舍友，快逃——</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2429">40:29</a> 我就是我的防御机制</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>结语</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2593">43:13</a> 高敏人格的试炼永不停歇</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>BGM：陈奕迅「Shall we talk」来自peiqin推荐</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>————End————</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpN_EcOeZEaYTgPevPQD2I1TJ7ex.m4a" length="43825422" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZxcmFYOElMSWszRmljc09KMFhHMnQ0T1RUYjUucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>01「婚龄分手」世界崩塌！恋爱脑的自救指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65edba4c8e6f71a5b7254863</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65edba4c8e6f71a5b7254863</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Mar 2024 13:48:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【今天有点烦 Vo.01】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 @远山遥</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 @渡渡鸟</span></p><span></span><p><span>我与鸟凑巧相识在她分手前期，在她身边目睹了至今三个月的分手过程，而九个月前我也经历了同样的事情，作为分手这件事的“毕业生”和“在读生”很快聊到了一起。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们拥有相近程度的感性与重情，说是“恋爱脑”也不为过。曾在我们生命中占有很大比例的爱情一旦被连根拔起，如何处理内心的巨大窟窿，变成我们30岁前后迟迟到来的生长痛。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>想不到我也分手了</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 四年恋爱断崖分手 我还在为他准备圣诞礼物</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 我以为的随便聊聊 没想到是最后的试探</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> 离开校园后 在社会中遇见爱情比想象中更难</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>恋爱脑的自救指南</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 爱情中受的伤只能在爱情中治愈</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="564">09:24</a> 父母劝说 爱情并不重要</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> 分手后我重拾的友谊更加珍贵</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 每次分手 我会做一个有益于我的重大改变</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a> 我独立 依旧渴求亲密关系</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="957">15:57</a> 遇见逃避型 让我从安全变成焦虑</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a> 情绪过山车 成瘾体验并不是爱情</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>没关系，凡事发生有利于我</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 正念！相信善意才能激发善意</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> 开始思考亲密关系 我更加了解人性</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1442">24:02</a> 非暴力沟通 把尖锐的矛盾揉碎在日常中</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 沉迷爱情 是我在逃避生存现实压力</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 是恋人也是朋友 关系更加稳固的基石</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">29:11</a> 接受分手是接受一个人的精神性死亡</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>结语</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 一切发生都会使我们更加强大</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>BGM：Jungkook「still with you」来自远山遥推荐</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>————End————</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luG1T7s6WhfoYrU9QTqlQJcu317f.m4a" length="33411295" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1NzliY0stUldoUVdGeTlzLWZpbC1KRW5NS1QucG5n.png"/>
